# Copy to mobile/.env and fill in from Supabase: Project Settings → API Keys.
# Leave empty to run the app in demo mode (mock data, demo sign-in code).
#
# The publishable key (sb_publishable_…) is designed to ship in apps: row-level
# security in supabase/migrations protects the data. Never put a secret key
# (sb_secret_…) or the legacy service_role key here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_KEY works too. Older projects without publishable keys
# can use the legacy anon key instead:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
